  "vcoins.roman.lore.0": "Forged from celestial meteorite deep within Mount Etna by Vulcan himself.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.1": "Carried by Legio X Equestris during their legendary campaign across the Rhine.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.2": "Once sealed beneath the Senate's secret vault, imbued with imperial authority.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.3": "A blade of dark steel that never chipped through hundreds of Colosseum duels.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.4": "Imbued with lightning from the Capitoline Hill during a tempest of Jupiter.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.5": "Vestment worn by victorious commanders during the Triumphus procession.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.6": "The pact of honor of free gladiators, symbolizing an unbroken spirit.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.7": "Cast from ancient alloys, resting beneath the Mediterranean Sea for centuries.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.8": "Fortified armor that shielded Centurions against volleys of barbarian arrows.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.9": "Arrows blessed by Apollo, blazing like the sunrise and incinerating targets.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.10": "Personal relic of Emperor Marcus Aurelius, inscribed with the oath to protect Roma.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.11": "Radiates an overwhelming aura like the tempestuous fury of the war goddess Bellona.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.12": "Carved through treacherous mountain passes to forge the great passage through the Alps.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.13": "Carries the blessing of Vesta, its inner sacred flame never extinguishing.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.14": "Emblazoned with the Aquila eagle, commanding the skies from Britannia to Euphrates.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.15": "Wields the oceanic power of Neptune, having quelled great storms in the Gulf of Naples.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.16": "Regalia of the Praetorian Prefect, standing resolute amidst endless perils.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.17": "Cast from meteoritic fragments, glowing with the eternal aura of Sol Invictus.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.18": "Talisman passed down by the priests of Janus, guiding its owner between life and death.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.19": "Keepsake of a legendary Centurion who stood his ground to the last breath.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.20": "Shattered the heavy shields of Carthaginian cavalry in the historic Punic Wars.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.21": "Absorbed the spiritual waters of the Tiber River, shielding its bearer from malice.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.22": "A siege weapon that brought down the mightiest fortress bastions of the East.",
  "vcoins.roman.lore.23": "An unyielding bulwark, standing as an enduring witness to Pax Romana.",

